Api POST #createOrder Create order (OrderController.createOrder)
Url http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Header
- Content-Type: 'application/json'
- Accept: 'application/json'
Body JSON `
{
  "customerId" : "sample_string",
  "amount" : 99.95,
  "currency" : "sample_string"
}
`

Api DELETE #cancelOrder Cancel order (OrderController.cancelOrder)
Url http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Header
- Accept: 'application/json'

Api GET #getOrder Get order (OrderController.getOrder)
Url http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Header
- Accept: 'application/json'

Task Order Lifecycle Workflow
    Step Call Api createOrder
        Capture
        - createdId: response.body.id
        - createStatus: response.status
        Check
        - createStatus == 201 OR createStatus == 200
        - createdId != null
    Step Call Api getOrder
        Params
        - orderId: createdId
        Check
        - $.status == 200
        - response.body.id == createdId
    Step Call Api cancelOrder
        Params
        - orderId: createdId
        Check
        - $.status == 204 OR $.status == 200

